# Build context is the repo root for Python services (they include libs/). Keep secrets, docs and local state out.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/tests/
docs/
**/impl_*.md
deploy/
*.log
*.pdf
.vscode/
.idea/
